- `c/misra-compliance.mdc`, `c++/misra-compliance.mdc`: language subsets
- `c/compiler-warnings.mdc`, `c++/static-analysis.mdc`: warnings and static analysis
- `c/memory-management.mdc`, `c++/memory-management.mdc`: this rule takes precedence; no dynamic memory after initialization in ASIL software
